.TH "REUSE-CONVERT-DEP5" "1" "Dec 17, 2025" "6.2.0" "reuse"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
reuse-convert-dep5 \- Convert .reuse/dep5 to REUSE.toml
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBreuse convert\-dep5\fP [\fIoptions\fP]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBreuse\-convert\-dep5\fP converts the \fB\&.reuse/dep5\fP file into a
functionally equivalent \fBREUSE.toml\fP file in the root of the project. The
\fB\&.reuse/dep5\fP file is subsequently deleted.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-help
Display help and exit.
.UNINDENT
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.sp
Given the following \fB\&.reuse/dep5\fP file:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging\-manuals/copyright\-format/1.0/
Upstream\-Name: Some project
Upstream\-Contact: Jane Doe
Source: https://example.com/
Disclaimer: Some rights reserved

Files: hello*.txt
Copyright: 2018 Jane Doe
License: MIT
Comment: hello world

Files: foo bar
Copyright: 2018 Jane Doe
    2019 John Doe
License: MIT
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The following \fBREUSE.toml\fP is generated:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
version = 1
SPDX\-PackageName = \(dqSome project\(dq
SPDX\-PackageSupplier = \(dqJane Doe\(dq
SPDX\-PackageDownloadLocation = \(dqhttps://example.com/\(dq
SPDX\-PackageComment = \(dqSome rights reserved\(dq

[[annotations]]
path = \(dqhello**.txt\(dq
precedence = \(dqaggregate\(dq
SPDX\-FileCopyrightText = \(dq2018 Jane Doe\(dq
SPDX\-License\-Identifier = \(dqMIT\(dq
SPDX\-FileComment = \(dqhello world\(dq

[[annotations]]
path = [\(dqfoo\(dq, \(dqbar\(dq]
precedence = \(dqaggregate\(dq
SPDX\-FileCopyrightText = [\(dq2018 Jane Doe\(dq, \(dq2019 John Doe\(dq]
SPDX\-License\-Identifier = \(dqMIT\(dq
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Free Software Foundation Europe
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
2017, Free Software Foundation Europe. CC-BY-SA-4.0
